// 5) 标题锚点：GitHub 风格 slug，与文档内已有 TOC 链接一致
function stripTags(s) { return s.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ''); }
function decode(s) {
  return s.replace(/&amp;/g, '&').replace(/&lt;/g, '<').replace(/&gt;/g, '>')
    .replace(/&quot;/g, '"').replace(/&#39;/g, "'").replace(/&nbsp;/g, ' ');
}
function slug(s) {
  return decode(stripTags(s)).trim().toLowerCase().replace(/\s+/g, '-').replace(/[^\p{L}\p{N}\-_]/gu, '');
}
const headings = [];
const seen = new Map();
html = html.replace(/<h([1-6])>([\s\S]*?)<\/h\1>/g, function (_m, lvl, inner) {
  const base = slug(inner);
  const n = seen.get(base) || 0;
  seen.set(base, n + 1);
  const id = n === 0 ? base : base + '-' + n;
  headings.push({ level: Number(lvl), id: id, text: decode(stripTags(inner)).trim() });
  return '<h' + lvl + ' id="' + id + '">' + inner + '<a class="anchor" href="#' + id + '" aria-label="链接到此节">#</a></h' + lvl + '>';
});

// 6) 还原围栏块
function esc(s) {
  return s.replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;');
}
html = html.replace(/<p>@@FENCE_(\d+)@@<\/p>/g, function (_m, n) {
  const b = blocks[Number(n)];
  if (b.svg) {
    return '<figure class="diagram"><div class="diagram-body">' + b.svg + '</div><figcaption>mermaid 图 · 已预渲染，脱机可见</figcaption></figure>';
  }
  return '<pre class="code"><code>' + esc(b.code.replace(/\n$/, '')) + '</code></pre>';
});

// 7) 证据等级徽标
const LEVELS = ['IMPLEMENTED_UNVERIFIED', 'VERIFIED', 'ATTEMPTED', 'CLAIMED', 'UNRESOLVED'];
LEVELS.forEach(function (lv) {
  html = html.replace(new RegExp('\\b' + lv + '\\b', 'g'), '<span class="lv lv-' + lv.toLowerCase() + '">' + lv + '</span>');
});

// 8) 表格横向滚动容器
html = html.replace(/<table>/g, '<div class="table-wrap"><table>').replace(/<\/table>/g, '</table></div>');

// 9) 侧栏目录
const toc = headings.filter(function (h) { return h.level === 2 || h.level === 3; }).map(function (h) {
  return '<a class="toc-l' + h.level + '" href="#' + h.id + '">' + esc(h.text) + '</a>';
}).join('\n');

// 10) 头部元数据
const META_ORDER = ['report_date', 'acceptance', 'report_kind', 'source_goal_state', 'source_thread_title', 'source_thread_id', 'source_branch', 'source_start', 'source_end', 'source_cutoff_line', 'source_prefix_sha256', 'source_worktree', 'source_jsonl'];
const metaRows = META_ORDER.filter(function (k) { return fm[k]; }).map(function (k) {
  const v = fm[k];
  const mono = /sha256|jsonl|worktree|thread|\d{4}-\d\d-\d\dT/.test(k) || v.length > 44;
  return '<div class="meta-row"><dt>' + esc(k) + '</dt><dd' + (mono ? ' class="mono"' : '') + ' title="' + esc(v) + '">' + esc(v) + '</dd></div>';
}).join('\n');

const title = (raw.match(/^# (.+)$/m) || [])[1] || '会话报告';
const CSS = readFileSync('/tmp/report.css', 'utf8');
const JS = readFileSync('/tmp/report.js', 'utf8');

const out = '<!doctype html>\n<html lang="zh-CN">\n<head>\n<meta charset="utf-8">\n'
  + '<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">\n'
  + '<title>' + esc(title) + '</title>\n<style>\n' + CSS + '\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n'
  + '<button id="toggle" aria-label="切换目录">☰</button>\n'
  + '<nav class="sidebar"><div class="sidebar-inner">\n'
  + '<div class="brand">会话报告可视化</div>\n'
  + '<input id="filter" type="search" placeholder="筛选章节…" aria-label="筛选章节">\n'
  + '<div class="toc" id="toc">\n' + toc + '\n</div>\n'
  + '<div class="legend"><div class="legend-title">证据等级</div>'
  + LEVELS.map(function (l) { return '<div class="legend-row"><span class="lv lv-' + l.toLowerCase() + '">' + l + '</span></div>'; }).join('')
  + '</div>\n</div></nav>\n'
  + '<main><div class="wrap">\n'
  + '<header class="hero"><h1>' + esc(title) + '</h1>\n'
  + '<div class="badges"><span class="badge b-danger">' + esc(fm.acceptance || '') + '</span><span class="badge">' + esc(fm.report_date || '') + '</span><span class="badge">' + esc(fm.report_kind || '') + '</span></div>\n'
  + '<dl class="meta">' + metaRows + '</dl></header>\n'
  + '<article class="content">' + html + '</article>\n'
  + '<footer class="foot">由 <code>' + esc(SRC.split('/').pop()) + '</code> 离线生成；图表已内联预渲染，可直接脱机打开。</footer>\n'
  + '</div></main>\n'
  + '<button id="totop" title="回到顶部" aria-label="回到顶部">↑</button>\n'
  + '<script>\n' + JS + '\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n';

writeFileSync(OUT, out);
